  "descripcion": "The Atomfall story continues with the “Wicked Isle” Story Expansion Pack, introducing a new location, enemies, quests, characters, items, weapons, and maybe even a way to escape. Explore the isle’s mysteries Uncover new treasures Face fearsome foes",
